From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 07:03:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Retro: a shader sky, and balloons in two palette banks
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

0 switches layer 0 on and off. On, the world simply does not draw its
sky — index 0, and the shader shows through it — which is also the
clearest demonstration that transparency means what it says. Off, the
indexed sky and its raster bar come back.

Three balloons are one sixteen-colour shape drawn three times, two banks
between them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0107-retro-a-shader-sky-and-balloons-in-two-palette-banks.patch 43162b23a2b0bd58e6f045e6ca4d0f559fc0cf6a15fac313ca5d4905964f18cd
---
